{"id":"wb-7-516","name":"茶马古道","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"茶马古道","text":"茶马古道是处于中国西南部的横断山区与青藏高原之间的古代商业路网，起自中国四川省的成都、雅安，云南省的昆明、普洱等地，终点为西藏的拉萨以及东南亚等地。路网遍布今四川省、云南省、贵州省和西藏自治区，横跨长江（金沙江）、澜沧江、怒江及雅鲁藏布江等四大流域，是内地汉族地区与其他民族经济往来的一种重要方式。为中国西南地区各民族间互通有无，进行经济、文化交流的纽带。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%8C%B6%E9%A9%AC%E5%8F%A4%E9%81%93","revisionId":95411172,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=95411172","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与所在地一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/ddc6821d131e753344660759.jpg","title":"茶马古道邛崃夹关国保碑.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E8%8C%B6%E9%A9%AC%E5%8F%A4%E9%81%93%E9%82%9B%E5%B4%83%E5%A4%B9%E5%85%B3%E5%9B%BD%E4%BF%9D%E7%A2%91.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/75/%E8%8C%B6%E9%A9%AC%E5%8F%A4%E9%81%93%E9%82%9B%E5%B4%83%E5%A4%B9%E5%85%B3%E5%9B%BD%E4%BF%9D%E7%A2%91.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Nekitarc","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"National key protected cultural site: Chama Gudao (Ancient Tea-horse Road), Jiaguan town, Qionglai, Sichuan.","width":320,"height":213}}